      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:iuqtmu'
    '|a||Мне нра́вится бале́т: you know it from lesson 19. I like ballet, in general.':
